# Public-repo .gitignore: deny everything by default, then allow only what's safe to publish.
#
# This pattern is intentionally restrictive because the repo is PUBLIC. Any file not
# explicitly allow-listed below stays local. Don't add allow-list entries without
# considering whether the file leaks personal commentary, raw data, or auth secrets.

# Deny everything
*

# Allow only the public dashboard + repo metadata + push tooling
!.gitignore
!README.md
!oil.html
!index.html
!push_dashboard.sh
